I was unsure how it should be done, my solution so far had been:

```lua
require("mini.indentscope").setup({
    options = { indent_at_cursor = false }
})
vim.g.miniindentscope_disable = true
```

until I had a thought: "hmm, why could this not forward-seek?" :)

Do you think the `g:...disable` way is a bad way to achieve it? I feel like I just randomly tried it, and since it worked, stuck with it.

